#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an environment variable (trusted environment) {#create-an-"
"environment-variable-trusted-environment}"
msgstr ""
"Crear una variable de entorno (entorno de confianza) {#create-an-"
"environment-variable-trusted-environment}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To set the IQP_API_TOKEN environment variable in your system, you can add "
"the following line to your shell profile (for example, .bashrc or .zshrc) or"
" by setting it directly in your terminal:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para configurar la variable de entorno `IQP_API_TOKEN` en tu sistema, puedes"
" agregar la siguiente línea a tu perfil de shell (por ejemplo, `.bashrc` o "
"`.zshrc`) o estableciéndola directamente en tu terminal:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    When you invoke the environment variable in your code, include `import os`, as in this example:\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```shell\n"
"    export IQP_API_TOKEN=<your-API_KEY> \n"
"    # Use the 44-character API_KEY you created and saved \n"
"    # from the IBM Quantum Platform Home dashboard\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Cuando invoques la variable de entorno en tu código, incluye `import os`, como en este ejemplo:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Note that when creating an environment variable, your API key is still stored locally in plain text, and should be safeguarded.\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    import os\n"
"    api_token = os.environ['IQP_API_TOKEN']\n"
"    ```\n"
"    Ten en cuenta que al crear una variable de entorno, tu clave API aún se almacena localmente en texto sin formato (plain text), y debe ser salvaguardada.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
